00:34:38.616 --> 00:34:43.492
We could just pop
into the party for a minute.

00:34:43.533 --> 00:34:45.117
Bridget,
I'm really sorry.

00:34:45.158 --> 00:34:48.658
I just can’t do it.
I've got to head back.

00:34:48.700 --> 00:34:50.158
Listen, Daniel...

00:34:50.242 --> 00:34:53.617
