to see a friendly face.

00:39:35.805 --> 00:39:37.555
Oh, now, listen,
I'll tell you what.

00:39:37.597 --> 00:39:40.514
I have an idea.
Let me finish this...

00:39:40.514 --> 00:39:42.055
