and we'll have dinner later, OK?

00:39:48.598 --> 00:39:50.265
Is there someone here?

00:39:50.306 --> 00:39:52.598
Not that I'm aware of.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:54.556
Unless that Bosnian family
