00:39:54.598 --> 00:39:55.765
Bastards.

00:40:07.891 --> 00:40:09.891
Oh.

00:40:09.932 --> 00:40:11.724
I'm sorry.

00:40:11.766 --> 00:40:12.976
Sorry.

00:40:15.643 --> 00:40:17.018
I'm going mad.

00:40:17.018 --> 00:40:19.226
Listen, I am feeling
really bad, actually.

00:40:19.268 --> 00:40:21.226
